id: og_exchange_c
name: Exchange III
description: Exchange. Three floors of switching frames that are indistinguishable from one another, and one cable shaft that is the only way to tell which of them you are on. Built as a telephone exchange; the switches were being decommissioned rack by rack and the work stopped halfway.

